# Stack

- **Next.js** (App Router) · **React** · **TypeScript** · **Tailwind CSS** · **Framer Motion** (light touch)

Upgrade major versions deliberately; patterns below stay valid across minor bumps.

# Architectural goals

- **SEO-first** routing and metadata APIs
- **Server Components by default**; Client only for interaction, motion, tracking bridges
- **Centralized** copy / metadata / FAQ / schema payloads under `data/` (or CMS) — single maintenance path
- **Scale** to many routes (projects, locales, property types, articles) without duplication

# Repository layout (canonical — retire duplicate trees elsewhere)

```
app/
components/
data/
hooks/
lib/
schemas/            # JSON-LD builders OR colocate with components; pick one pattern per repo
seo/                # optional: sitemap, robots helpers, metadata factories
public/
styles/             # if needed beyond Tailwind
```

