# Styling

- Tailwind **utility-first**; avoid inline style sprawl; design tokens via Tailwind theme extension when repeating.

# Motion

- Framer Motion: **subtle** reveals; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; never block interaction.

# Performance checklist

- Optimize **LCP** (hero image, font loading strategy)
- Control **bundle** size; dynamic import heavy below-the-fold widgets
- **INP**: minimize client JS on first paint
- Core Web Vitals monitored in CI or periodic Lighthouse

# Accessibility

Semantic sections, focus states, **meaningful** heading order cooperating with **15** H1 rules, visible focus for keyboard users.

# Data architecture

- `data/projects/`, `metadata/`, `faq/`, `blog/` — typed models (TS) feeding pages + JSON-LD (**08**)

# AI / crawl friendliness

- Clean URL slugs (**15**), structured sections (**03**), entity-rich but honest copy (**02**, **04**)

# Scalability

Patterns should support **hundreds** of URLs: shared templates, composition over one-off pages, avoid forked metadata.
